B06.1 — Local queue integration
Reference: BitChord b690dc146009d4815825fa4a20815ef2e4ee8898,
app/src/main/java/com/music/bitchord/playback/QueueCoordinator.kt,
app/src/main/java/com/music/bitchord/ui/components/SongActionsMenu.kt,
and sharedUi/src/jvmSharedMain/kotlin/com/music/bitchord/ui/player/PlayerQueue.kt.
Original BitChord contributors, GPLv3 per upstream LICENSE; upstream notices retained.
Changes: activate the existing Aurelis queue renderer, serialize per-occurrence
identity and tiers, use Media3 in-place edits, add local Play Next callbacks,
accessible reorder actions and reduced-motion behavior. The active queue displays
the canonical physical timeline; no remote/party queue logic is imported.
Play Next while shuffle is enabled remains unavailable with an explanation until
the session owns an explicit shuffled-successor policy. Aurelis integration and
tests do not replace third-party authorship or change their licence terms.

B07.1 — Local rich lyric formats and timing persistence
Reference: BitChord b690dc146009d4815825fa4a20815ef2e4ee8898,
shared/src/jvmSharedMain/kotlin/com/music/bitchord/data/lyrics/EnhancedLrc.kt
and shared/src/jvmSharedMain/kotlin/com/music/bitchord/data/lyrics/TtmlLyrics.kt.
Original BitChord contributors, GPLv3 per upstream LICENSE; existing notices retained.
Changes: connect the existing parsers to local imports, repeated stamps/offsets,
namespace and bounded XML handling, safe entities and lossless local cache metadata.
Existing word/syllable model and helpers reused; no new external lyric service.
Original short test fixtures and cache integration are Aurelis contributions;
no commercial lyrics or replacement of third-party authorship is included.

B07.2 — Local lyric frame clock and swept text
Reference: BitChord b690dc146009d4815825fa4a20815ef2e4ee8898,
sharedUi/src/jvmSharedMain/kotlin/com/music/bitchord/ui/player/PlayerLyrics.kt
(offset/playhead, foreground frame loop, swept-line and clipping sections)
and sharedUi/src/jvmSharedMain/kotlin/com/music/bitchord/ui/player/LyricClock.kt.
Original BitChord contributors, GPLv3 per upstream LICENSE; prior notices retained.
Changes: adapt existing local clock to Media3 discontinuities/lifecycle, draw-time
prefix/grapheme clipping with native text shaping and bidi, measured focus,
manual following and coherent offset math. No full upstream renderer port claimed.
Original integration/fixtures are Aurelis contributions without replacing third-party authorship.

