B08 — local-first lyric providers and configured translation
----------------------------------------------------------
Reference reviewed: BitChord b690dc146009d4815825fa4a20815ef2e4ee8898,
shared/src/jvmSharedMain/kotlin/com/music/bitchord/data/lyrics/
LyricsRepository.kt, LrcLib.kt, BetterLyrics.kt, BiniLyrics.kt,
LrcRed.kt and LyricsTranslation.kt.
Original BitChord contributors, GPLv3 per upstream LICENSE; existing notices
and the original copyright above remain applicable to adapted code.
Aurelis additions provide an explicit provider registry, cancellable bounded
HTTP requests, diagnostics, and integration with the existing local repository,
player and configured LibreTranslate-compatible client. No new third-party
library, model, font or native binary is introduced by this block.
A client code license does not license the lyrics served by a third party.
Only LRCLIB is enabled for explicit lookup. BetterLyrics, BiniLyrics and lrc.red
remain disabled pending verified service/content terms. Other legacy provider
clients and unofficial translation endpoints are not connected to the active
lookup/translation flow. See docs/migration/beta-local/B08_PROVIDERS.md and
LICENSE_AUDIT.md for the scope, evidence and outstanding verification.
